  "downloads": 3484,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Introduction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Turning camo dreams into reality.</p>\n<p>Anime &amp; LARP includes <strong>30</strong> Presets, Textures, &amp; Stickers.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>21 M4 Presets |  <em>M4’s need a break..</em></li>\n<li>7 AK Presets</li>\n<li>4 G36 Presets</li>\n<li>3 Scar Preset</li>\n<li>1 Glock Preset</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kLb3NoX.png\" alt=\"\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/f55SUFr.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>Maybe a glock fade included somewhere..</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">GIF Previews</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Anime Skins</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/aYYV4MV.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<h3>LARP Skins</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/xAYWHzm.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<h3>Skins Are Compatible with Most Weapon Builds</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vDjYZEy.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<blockquote>\n<p>📝 <strong>Note:</strong> Weapon camo presets are tailor made for specific weapon families.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>(E.g M4 camo preset = M4, ADAR, HK 416, SR-25, TX-15, etc.)</strong></p>\n<p>❗Not responsible if camo doesn’t look good outside of weapon camo name.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">CAMO MODULAR &amp; MAG ERASER</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>CAMO MODULAR</h3>\n<p>Paints are <strong>labelled.</strong> Customize as you see fit.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/qcCjZwo.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<h3>MAG ERASER</h3>\n<p><strong>Optional</strong> “Mag Eraser” built in to eliminate camo. Included with every preset.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/kywT9t7.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">⚠ &gt;READ&lt; RECOMMENDED ADDON PACKS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Download these addons otherwise you will need to replace textures/masks/stickers yourself</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/40/essential-texture-pack#description\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Essential Texture Pack</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/42/utanus-tarkov-texture-pack\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Utanu’s Tarkov Texture Pack</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/43/camos-misc-markers\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Camos, Misc &amp; Markers</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/52/azukatas-anime-assortment\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Azukata’s Anime Assortment</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/57/cod-camos\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">COD camos</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/47/spirits-embroidery\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spirit’s Embroidery</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/67/black-ops-3-base-and-cut-camos\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Black Ops 3 Base and Cut Camos</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<h3>Please report issues in the comments section</h3>\n<h4>Shoutout to the WTT community for hyping my creations &amp; 7Bpencil for taking my suggestions to help expedite my work.</h4></div></div></div>\n",
